<h5><b>International Library Coverage:</b></h5>

<p>A strong review process, prompt indexing, and timely appraisal of national and international publications received from authors or publishers characterize the open access, public article and book directory known as IL, which covers all branches of science. </p>

<h5><b>Evaluation Ethics and Evaluation Malpractice Statement:</b></h5>
Regardless of the country or language of the article, the IL review team assesses it in accordance with guidelines. 
The evaluation was conducted impartially. The evaluation team expresses its ideas regarding the article in a straightforward and persuasive manner. 
The Article Score (IL-Score), which is the average of a few variables, will also be graded. 
The review team will also take into account any content overlap or resemblance between the article being evaluated and other articles.

